WEBVTT

00:03:30.038 --> 00:03:34.871
The expectation is that
the more we could just be ourselves,

00:03:34.913 --> 00:03:39.163
perhaps, just maybe,
others will follow suit.

00:03:40.121 --> 00:03:42.454
The hope is that soon enough

00:03:42.496 --> 00:03:46.371
the culture of the entire
organization will shift,

00:03:46.413 --> 00:03:50.204
becoming more inclusive
and welcoming of difference.

00:03:50.913 --> 00:03:52.496
My type of difference.

00:03:53.454 --> 00:03:57.621
So I show up to work as I am,

00:03:57.663 --> 00:04:00.538
with my Afro, my family photos,